<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Mon Portfolio 🚀</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .profile-card {
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px;
      max-width: 400px;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    h1 {
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: white;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="profile-card">
    <h1>👋 Salut, c'est moi !</h1>
    <p>Développeur passionné en pleine ascension sur le web. Je conçois, j'apprends et je mets mes projets en ligne.</p>
    <div class="tag">🚀 En route vers le succès</div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
